        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion SF-A2, Cast Modern Curved Stainless Steel Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nGoing with the saying: what is old is new again, the redolent shape of the SF-A2 door lever is a great way to add a little retro flair to your home but in a very contemporary way. This Fusion made stainless steel door handle is basic enough in its design to beautifully integrate into any décor; but what is most appealing about this handle is that it’s timeless. Instead of just another plain door lever, this fashionable leverset can just as easily hearken back to images of vintage homes, as it can meld into modern-day minimalism, or exude its charming sci-fi qualities—all while adding just the right amount of interesting detail to your doors. Available in either brushed stainless steel or polished stainless steel finishes, this lever and rose set will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion SF-A2 Simple Stainless Steel Lever With Contemporary Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Stainless Steel Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>\"Positive Stop\" lever spring mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Simple SF-A2 Stainless Steel Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Retro Stainless Steel Leverset, Fusion SF-A2",
                "description": "Cast Stainless Steel Leverset Fusion SF-A2 - Instead of just another plain door lever, this fashionable leverset can just as easily hearken back to images of vintage homes, as it can meld into modern-day minimalism, or exude its charming sci-fi qualities—all while adding just the right amount of interesting detail to your doors. Available in either Brushed Stainless Steel or Polished Stainless Steel finishes, this lever and rose set will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and can be adjusted for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.",
                "keywords": "FUS-SF-A2, fusion SF-a2, fusion hardware contemporary series Levers, fusion stainless steel Levers, modern door Levers, fusion contemporary stainless steel door Levers, fusion SF 3010 Levers, fusion A2 contemporary roses, fusion hardware 3010 leversets, fusion hardware 3000 series, retro door levers, timeless door levers, stylish door levers,"
